Subject: [PATCH] apps: meter and diagnose the Walleye IMX362 phase stream

Capture the validated VC1 Y10 route and restore the previous media graph
and sensor controls on exit. Meter settled pairs at fixed settings, report
temporal noise and phase-window contrast, and retain calibration-free raw
replay. Register the padded monochrome bus format in the subdevice table.

diff --git a/src/apps/imx362-pdaf/main.cpp b/src/apps/imx362-pdaf/main.cpp
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..4b522bf
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/apps/imx362-pdaf/main.cpp
@@ -0,0 +1,572 @@
